<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In resurrection and through death,</l><l>You mingled God with man—</l><l>Produced Your Body, consummating</l><l>The New Jerusalem.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For You Lord, open my heart wide.</l><l>With others build me up.</l><l>In You we would together blend,</l><l>Enjoy Salvation’s cup.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
